__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.pyright_cache/

# Atomic-write temporaries (..playerlist.garou3299.json.<random>.tmp). The
# scripts always delete them, even when interrupted -- but a SIGKILL cannot
# run that cleanup, so keep such a leftover out of `git add -A`.
.*.tmp

# Local testing aid, deliberately not shipped: a catalogue of every message the
# bot can print, used to spot drift between the code and its documentation. It
# is a manual, not part of the bot -- nothing reads it at runtime -- and a
# stale copy would describe messages the code no longer sends, so it stays out
# of the repository and out of every pull request.
docs/bot-messages.md
